    "about-prototype": {
      "type": "page-about-split",
      "settings": {
        "image_url": "https://barreletics.com/cdn/shop/files/b.jpg?v=1637617000&width=1400",
        "image_alt": "Early Performance Skin prototypes",
        "media_column_pct": 50,
        "title": "The idea became the product.",
        "body": "<p>One day, stuck in side plank and sliding yet again, it became clear: this was not just inconvenient. It was holding us back.</p><p>That same evening, I tore the silicone sleeve off a water bottle, cut it up, and made the first prototype. Far from perfect. But it worked.</p><p>Two years of testing followed: pressure points, fit, flexibility, material, true all-over grip. Performance Skins were born: patented studio footwear, designed and manufactured in the USA. Built to feel secure and connected. Built to stay out of the way of the workout.</p>",
        "reverse": true,
        "mobile_stack_order": "media_first",
        "aria_label": "From prototype to Performance Skins",
        "media_max_px": 500,
        "media_max_px_mobile": 360,
