            "question": "What is Barreletics?",
            "answer": "<p>Barreletics makes patented Performance Skins — studio footwear for Pilates, barre, Reformer, Cadillac Reformer, Lagree, Megaformer, and yoga on or off the mat. Founded in Michigan by Stefanie Miller. Made in the USA. One pair replaces traditional studio socks with full-contact 360° grip.</p>"
