          "type": "geo_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Open Sole or Closed Sole?",
            "answer": "<p>Closed Sole covers the whole foot, heel included. Open Sole leaves the heel open with a mid-foot vent for a grounded, barefoot feel. Toes stay exposed on both for natural splay. Same grip, same stability. The choice is feel.</p>"
          }
        },
