          "type": "geo_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does this relate to Joseph Pilates and Contrology?",
            "answer": "<p>Joseph Pilates built Contrology on the body\u2019s connection to the apparatus. The feet belong in that system: Reformer, Cadillac, Wunda Chair, and mat. Performance Skins keep a sock from breaking that connection by slipping or holding moisture.</p>"
